WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:12.816
Shops advertise "wedding-parent specialist," but when you actually go, parents often end up mixed in with brides.

2
00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.736
So let me show you an easy way to tell the difference.

3
00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:22.224
First, look carefully at their portfolio.

4
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.560
Check the photos posted on their website, Instagram, or blog.

5
00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:40.368
Since image matters so much in makeup and hair, shops post whatever they want to be known for — so if most of the photos are brides or young models, is that really a wedding-parent specialist?

6
00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:45.264
If most of the photos are of wedding parents, that's a genuine wedding-parent specialist.

7
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:56.136
Specialization matters because it means the shop has focused, studied, and gained years of experience in one specific area.

8
00:00:56.472 --> 00:01:04.560
Specializing in parents in their 50s and 60s, who need much more correcting than brides in their 20s and 30s, means

9
00:01:04.896 --> 00:01:14.016
the head artist or a specialist personally handles them, delivering high satisfaction and quality results.

10
00:01:14.352 --> 00:01:21.768
So a genuine specialist should have an overwhelming amount of real work photos and data of actual wedding parents.

11
00:01:22.104 --> 00:01:33.456
Look especially for real client photos showing how they addressed crown thinning or corrected droopy eyes.

12
00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:37.728
Also check for content like "styling short hair" or "tips for using wigs,"

13
00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:48.768
and "personal color hanbok pairing" — active, well-researched content aimed at wedding parents is a good sign of real expertise.

14
00:01:49.104 --> 00:01:55.392
A genuine wedding-parent specialist like this is one you can trust with your parents on this precious day.

15
00:01:55.728 --> 00:02:03.648
In short, if the photos on their site are mostly of wedding parents, it's a real specialist.

16
00:02:03.984 --> 00:02:07.008
You can book with confidence.
